## Scope

- Add `ts dashboard connect`, status, disconnect/revoke, enqueue, worker, and safety-pass surfaces.
- Reuse protected user-local state and never copy credentials into project state or logs.
- Report only schema-validated current state, material events, App Server counters/failure groups,
  and Work Efficiency aggregates with counter epochs and explicit measurement coverage.
- Prove duplicate launcher and duplicate message prevention separately.

## Safety Boundaries

- Outbound HTTPS only; no inbound workstation service.
- No permanent daemon requirement and no unsupported scheduler installation mutation.
- No raw logs, prompts, responses, source, paths, commands, or credentials in payloads.
